{"applicationId":"antifragile-floor","applicationRevision":"1","builder":{"contact":"https://github.com/ToanPham247","githubLogin":"ToanPham247","githubUserId":"173402366"},"contract":{"id":"public-pr-application-v3","submissionStandard":"2.0.0","validatorProfile":"intent-open-world-v1","version":"3.1.0"},"declarations":{"historicalEvidencePreserved":true,"noApprovalClaim":true,"noInheritedApproval":true,"noSecretsDeclared":true,"noUniswapEndorsementClaim":true,"publicInformationAcknowledged":true},"fidelity":{"reasonCode":null,"requirementBindings":[],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","status":"unassessed"},"intentCapture":{"agentInterpretationStatus":"unconfirmed","captureStatus":"captured-verbatim-public-safe","facts":[{"confirmationStatus":"unconfirmed","id":"builder-public-idea","provenance":"owner-stated","sourceReferences":["original-idea"],"statement":"Antifragile Floor — a Uniswap v4 hook.\n\nA single custom v4 hook where every swap skims a project charge (20 bps) into a quote-asset (WETH) reserve that funds a monotonic, ratchet-only price floor; on exact-input sells the hook tops the seller up from the reserve toward the floor AFTER the AMM executes the full swap (the core AMM leg is always the full swap; the hook adds no pricing math of its own), and the mandatory 10 bps Programmable volume fee accrues as an owner-only claimable liability.\n\nUser outcome: A creator launches a WETH-paired token whose exact-input sellers are subsidised toward a transparent, on-chain price floor that only ratchets up, funded by the pool's own trading volume, with no admin, oracle, keeper or upgrade.\n\nWhy v4: Only a v4 hook can (a) collect the mandatory volume fee non-bypassably through quadrant-dependent beforeSwap/afterSwap return deltas on the quote side of every canonical-pool swap, and (b) read the executed swap BalanceDelta in afterSwap and pay a reserve-funded top-up toward the monotonic floor as an afterSwapReturnDelta, atomically, from aggregate pool state without any per-user identity.\n"}],"ideaSourcePath":"submission-v2/idea-source.v1.json","ideaSourceRepositoryRef":"primary","ideaSourceSha256":"sha256:f1ea1a1093f508565ef2b39532de87e7bf4ca976a38511cfc11479f9770b63e1","language":"und","originalIdeaDisplayExcerpt":"Antifragile Floor — a Uniswap v4 hook.\n\nA single custom v4 hook where every swap skims a project charge (20 bps) into a quote-asset (WETH) reserve that funds a monotonic, ratchet-only price floor; on exact-input sells the hook tops the seller up from the reserve toward the floor AFTER the AMM executes the full swap (the core AMM leg is always the full swap; the hook adds no pricing math of its own), and the mandatory 10 bps Programmable volume fee accrues as an owner-only claimable liability.\n\nUser outcome: A creator launches a WETH-paired token whose exact-input sellers are subsidised toward a transparent, on-chain price floor that only ratchets up, funded by the pool's own trading volume, with no admin, oracle, keeper or upgrade.\n\nWhy v4: Only a v4 hook can (a) collect the mandatory volume fee non-bypassably through quadrant-dependent beforeSwap/afterSwap return deltas on the quote side of every canonical-pool swap, and (b) read the executed swap BalanceDelta in afterSwap and pay a reserve-funded top-up toward the monotonic floor as an afterSwapReturnDelta, atomically, from aggregate pool state without any per-user identity.\n","schemaVersion":"1.0.0","unresolvedMaterialDecisions":["The builder idea is captured, but its architecture has not been interpreted or confirmed yet."]},"lineage":{"kind":"new","previous":null},"policyBindings":{"feeApplicability":"not-selected","feePolicyInstancePath":null,"feePolicyInstanceRepositoryRef":null,"feePolicyInstanceSha256":null,"feePolicySchemaId":null,"feePolicySchemaPath":null,"feePolicySchemaRepositoryRef":null,"feePolicySchemaSha256":null,"programmableFeePolicyHash":null,"programmableFeePolicyHashPreimage":null,"programmableFeePolicyId":null,"programmableFeePolicyVersion":n